  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong>Curtain MOD</strong> | <a href=\"https://github.com/Gu-ZT/Curtain/blob/main/docs/README.CN.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">窗簾</a></h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Gu-ZT/Curtain/actions/workflows/build.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Gu-ZT/Curtain/actions/workflows/build.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"開發版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curtain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_845348_downloads.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcurtain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">![Modrinth 下載次數](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fmodrinth%252fdt%252fcurtain%253fcolor%253d00AF5C%2526label%253dModrinth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/curtain?color=00AF5C&label=Modrinth</a> downloads&amp;logo=modrinth) </a>![GitHub 下載次數](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fgithub%252fdownloads%252fGu-ZT%252fCurtain%252ftotal%253flabel%253dGithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Gu-ZT/Curtain/total?label=Github</a> downloads&amp;logo=github)</p>\n<h2>適用於 Minecraft 1.21+ NeoForge，您可以使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rolling-gate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RollingGate</a></h2>\n<p>類似 <a href=\"https://github.com/gnembon/fabric-carpet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">fabric-carpet</a> 的 Forge 模組</p>\n<p>Curtain Mod 是一款專為 Forge Minecraft 設計的模組，讓你能夠從遊戲技術層面完全掌控關鍵機制。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <code>/log</code> 即時查看伺服器生物上限、TPS 等數據更新</li>\n<li>使用 <code>/player</code> 控制或生成玩家</li>\n<li>……</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>如何使用？</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>請參考<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforums.minecraftforge.net%252ftopic%252f89239-excessively-asked-questions-eaq%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>所有 Forge 模組的安裝說明，將 <code>curtain...jar</code> 放入 <code>mods</code> 資料夾，並與其他相容模組一同放置。</li>\n<li>使用 <code>/curtain</code> 指令開啟 Curtain 的主選單。<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/642/622/2023-04-02-223346.png\" alt=\"主選單\"></li></ul></li>\n<li>點擊彩色按鈕以啟用或停用窗簾規則。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Curtain Mod 規則</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Gu-ZT/Curtain/blob/main/docs/RULES.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>基於以下專案</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gnembon/fabric-carpet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Carpet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Gu-ZT/gugle-carpet-addition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GCA</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/plusls/plusls-carpet-addition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PCA</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TISUnion/Carpet-TIS-Addition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Carpet TIS Addition</a></li>\n</ul></p>",
